      "statement":"[TRUE_IS_COMPLIANT] For the selected control, Paragraph 3.11 gift restriction for one offered benefit, true means that the in-scope benefit is either not a gift or qualifies for the fee-or-charge discount exception. False means that it is an in-scope gift outside that exception and fails the stated should-not-offer standard. This is a proposed interpretation of that control only; it does not determine compliance of other offer components, section 103 compliance or whole-firm compliance.",
